{"attempt_id": "attempt:um-ep-616-erd-s-problem-616-131f8e50-source-fidelity-01", "created_at": "2026-09-06T08:00:00Z", "graph_id": "graph:um-ep-616-erd-s-problem-616-131f8e50-v1", "obligations": [{"acceptance": {"allowed_candidate_kinds": ["proof", "counterexample", "formalization", "computation"], "required_capabilities": ["human_review", "statement_faithfulness"]}, "dependencies": ["obligation:um-ep-616-erd-s-problem-616-131f8e50-statement-fidelity"], "kind": "root_claim", "obligation_id": "obligation:um-ep-616-erd-s-problem-616-131f8e50-root", "source_refs": ["https://www.unsolvedmath.com/problems/EP-616"], "statement": {"formal_declaration": null, "language": "en", "text": "Let $r\\geq 3$. For an $r$-uniform hypergraph $G$ let $\\tau(G)$ denote the covering number (or transversal number), the minimum size of a set of vertices which includes at least one from each edge in $G$. Determine the best possible $t$ such that, if $G$ is an $r$-uniform hypergraph $G$ where every subgraph $G'$ on at most $3r-3$ vertices has $\\tau(G')\\leq 1$, we have $\\tau(G)\\leq t$."}, "statement_sha256": "d59f01b05b58e546512b862f744b6ac08625f1dbc4c7478fff050d058917f0ec"}, {"acceptance": {"allowed_candidate_kinds": ["proof"], "required_capabilities": ["human_review", "statement_faithfulness"]}, "dependencies": [], "kind": "definition", "obligation_id": "obligation:um-ep-616-erd-s-problem-616-131f8e50-statement-fidelity", "source_refs": ["https://www.unsolvedmath.com/problems/EP-616"], "statement": {"formal_declaration": null, "language": "en", "text": "Verify against the cited source that the frozen statement is complete, current, untruncated, attribution-correct, and unambiguous enough for mathematical research; record any definition or quantifier gap without silently editing the contract."}, "statement_sha256": "65f0b3d574bd6d837403149dab6434c0f571709f7eb5bb066c7e8774bad13f34"}], "problem_contract_sha256": "adf71984c660589581543a447be46bbacfb09515d82b35aafca2914a81648987", "problem_